# Change Log

## 4.0.0

### Added

- Third-party storage support: 100 operations that address a file, folder or room (for example `GetFileInfo`, `GetFolderByFolderId`, `UpdateRoom`, `UploadFile`, the sharing and upload-session operations) take the identifier as `interface{}`, so it can be a numeric portal identifier or the string identifier of an entry in a connected third-party storage (for example `"sbox-42"`); `SaveFileAsPdf` and `StartFileConversion` take their body as `interface{}` to accept either `SaveAsPdfRequest` or `ThirdPartySaveAsPdfRequest` and either `CheckConversionRequestDto` or `ThirdPartyCheckConversionRequestDto`; added the `ThirdParty*` models (`ThirdPartyFileWrapper`, `ThirdPartyFolderWrapper`, `ThirdPartyFolderContentWrapper`, `ThirdPartyChunkedUploadSessionWrapper` and others)
- Added the reworked AI API in `api-aiai.go` and `api-ai-*.go`: `AIAIAPIService` (sending messages with or without streaming, regenerating answers, approving and denying tool calls), `AIAssignmentsAPIService`, `AIAttachmentsAPIService`, `AIContextAPIService`, `AIEditorToolsAPIService`, `AIExportAPIService`, `AIOpenAIPassthroughAPIService`, `AIPreferencesAPIService`, `AIProfilesAPIService`, `AIPromptsAPIService`, `AIThreadsAPIService`, `AIToolsAPIService` and `AIWebSearchAPIService`; `AISettingsAPIService` gains `AiSettingsGetToolMode` and `AiSettingsSetToolMode`
- Added `FilesMetadataAPIService` (`api-files-metadata.go`): metadata templates and their fields, assigning templates to files and folders, custom fields and field values; the folder listings (`GetFolderByFolderId`, `GetMyFolder`, `GetRecentFolder`, `GetFavoritesFolder`, `GetTrashFolder`, `GetRoomsFolder`) take `metadataTemplateId` and `metadataFilters`, the new `SearchFolder` and `SearchRooms` find entries by their metadata, and files and folders carry `assignedMetadataTemplates` and `metadataMatches`
- Added `AppsAPIService` (`api-apps.go`), `RoomsPrivacyRoomAPIService` (`api-rooms-privacy-room.go`, the users' encryption keys for privacy rooms) and `SettingsDocsCloudAPIService` (`api-settings-docs-cloud.go`)
- Added the Files operations `GetFormsFolder`, `GetRoomAiFolder`, `ShowQuickActions`, `GetEncryptionInfo`, `SetEncryptionInfo` and `GetEncryptionAccess`; `GetRoomsFolder` takes `privacyFilter` and `withAiFolder`, `GetFolderByFolderId` and `EmptyTrash` take `folderType`
- Report generation: `CreateReportFolderHistory`, `CreateAuditTrailReport` and `CreateLoginHistoryReport` take `format`, `from` and `to` and return a `DocumentBuilderTaskWrapper`; the new `GetReportFolderHistory`, `GetAuditTrailReport`, `GetLoginHistoryReport` and the matching `Terminate*` operations follow and cancel the report
- Added the payment operations `GetActiveServices`, `GetAccountingServicePrices`, `GetSubscriptionBalanceInfo`, `MoveSubscriptionToWallet`, `GetCustomerServiceUsage` and `GetCustomerMonthlyUsage` with their `Create*Report`, `Get*Report` and `Terminate*Report` operations, and `GetUpcomingPayments` in `PortalQuotaAPIService`; `GetPaymentQuotas` takes `additional`
- Added `GetBackupsCounts` (`BackupAPIService`) and `RefreshWebPlugin` (`SettingsWebpluginsAPIService`)
- Added model properties: `showQuickActions` to `FilesSettingsDto`, `formsUsedSpace` to `FilesStatisticsResultDto`, `ai` to `CustomizationConfigDto`, `isDelayedPaymentMethod` and `paymentMethodType` to `CustomerInfoDto`, `searchArea` to `RoomGroupDto` and `RoomGroupRequestDto`, `walletLowBalance` to `SettingsDto`, `runtime` to `WebPluginDto`, `toolPermissionMode` to `AiSettingsDto` and `AiUserSettingsDto`, `lastModified` to `TenantAiAccessSettingsDto`, `TenantBannerSettingsDto` and `TenantDevToolsAccessSettingsDto`, `errors` to `ProblemDetail`; `OperationDto` describes the source of a charge with `sourceId`, `sourceTitle`, `sourceType`, `cost` and `tokenUsage` instead of `agentId` and `agentTitle`
- Added enum values: `FOLDERTYPE_Forms` and `FOLDERTYPE_Ai`; `TENANTWALLETSERVICE_Admin`, `TENANTWALLETSERVICE_DocsCloud`, `TENANTWALLETSERVICE_DocsCloudDevPack` and `TENANTWALLETSERVICE_AISearch`; new audit actions in `MessageAction`
- Added the error body models `ErrorApiResponse` and `ValidationErrorResponse` (with `FieldError`)

### Changed

- The module path is now `github.com/ONLYOFFICE/docspace-api-sdk-go/v4` instead of `github.com/ONLYOFFICE/docspace-api-sdk-go/v3`: update the import paths and the `require` line in `go.mod`
- Files, folders and rooms use one set of models for numeric identifiers: the `Integer` suffix is gone (`FileIntegerWrapper` → `FileWrapper`, `FolderIntegerWrapper` → `FolderWrapper`, `FolderContentIntegerWrapper` → `FolderContentWrapper`, `FileDtoInteger` → `FileDto`, `FolderDtoInteger` → `FolderDto`, `ConfigurationIntegerWrapper` → `ConfigurationWrapper`, `UploadSessionResponseIntegerWrapper` → `UploadSessionResponseWrapper`, `OrdersRequestDtoInteger` → `OrdersRequestDto`, `UpdateRoomsQuotaRequestDtoInteger` → `UpdateRoomsQuotaRequestDto` and so on), and the `String` variants became `ThirdParty*` models (`FolderStringWrapper` → `ThirdPartyFolderWrapper`, `FolderDtoString` → `ThirdPartyFolderDto`, `FileEntryDtoString` → `ThirdPartyFileEntryDto`); the chunked-upload operations return `ChunkedUploadSessionWrapper` and `ChunkedUploadSessionResultWrapper`
- Renamed the request models with the plural `Requests` to the singular (`AuthRequestsDto` → `AuthRequestDto`, `SsoSettingsRequestsDto` → `SsoSettingsRequestDto`, `TfaRequestsDto` → `TfaRequestDto`, `StorageRequestsDto` → `StorageRequestDto`, `CspRequestsDto` → `CspRequestDto`, `WhiteLabelRequestsDto` → `WhiteLabelRequestDto`, `WebPluginRequests` → `WebPluginRequest` and the rest), and the JSON bodies nested in a request take a `Request` suffix (`Delete` → `DeleteFileRequest`, `DeleteFolder` → `DeleteFolderRequest`, `CreateFolder` → `CreateFolderRequest`, `CreateFileJsonElement` → `CreateFileRequest`, `CreateTextOrHtmlFile` → `CreateTextOrHtmlFileRequest`, `CopyAsJsonElement` → `CopyAsRequest`, `UpdateFile` → `UpdateFileRequest`, `LockFileParameters` → `LockFileRequest`, `StartEdit` → `StartEditRequest`, `MentionMessageWrapper` → `MentionMessageRequest`, `EmailValidationKeyModel` → `CheckConfirmRequestDto`); the JSON sent is unchanged, but the request method that sets the body is named after its model, so it changes with it (`AuthenticateMe(ctx).AuthRequestsDto(...)` → `AuthenticateMe(ctx).AuthRequestDto(...)`, `CreateFolder(ctx, id).CreateFolder(...)` → `CreateFolder(ctx, id).CreateFolderRequest(...)`); `DeleteTemplates` and `ChangeDefaultAccessRights` set their identifier lists with `DeleteTemplateFilesRequestDto(...)` and `DefaultAccessRightsRequestDto(...)` instead of `RequestBody(...)`
- Settings, database entities and other server-side classes are no longer published as models: each one became a `Dto` of the same shape (`TenantQuota` → `TenantQuotaDto`, `Balance` → `BalanceDto`, `Tariff` → `TariffDto`, `BackupProgress` → `BackupProgressDto`, `CoEditingConfig` → `CoEditingConfigDto`, `Logo` → `LogoDto`, `StorageSettings` → `StorageSettingsDto`, `DarkThemeSettings` → `DarkThemeSettingsDto`, `WizardSettings` → `WizardSettingsDto` and so on) or a model named after what it carries (`UserInfo` → `PortalUserDto`, `FireBaseUser` → `FirebaseDeviceDto`, `ThirdPartyParams` → `ThirdPartyAccountDto`, `CompanyWhiteLabelSettings` → `LicensorDetailsDto`, `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettings` → `AdditionalResourcesDto`, `SsoSettingsV2` → `SsoSettingsDto`, `IPRestriction` → `IpRestrictionDto`, `SetupCode` → `TfaSetupCodeDto`); the room, user and AI agent quota settings are all returned as `EntityQuotaSettingsWrapper`
- The settings sent in a request body take the name of their operation and keep every field (`TenantWalletSettingsWrapper` → `TenantWalletSettingsRequestDto` with `SetWalletTopUpSettingsRequest`, `TenantAuditSettingsWrapper` → `TenantAuditSettingsRequestDto` with `SetAuditLifetimeSettingsRequest`, `CompanyWhiteLabelSettingsWrapper` → `CompanyWhiteLabelSettingsRequestDto` with `SaveCompanyInfoRequest`, `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettingsWrapper` → `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettingsRequestDto` with `SaveAdditionalResourcesRequest`, `ExternalDatabaseSettings` → `ExternalDatabaseConnectionRequestDto`, `EmailActivationSettings` → `EmailActivationSettingsRequestDto`); `GetTenantWalletSettings`, `GetAuditSettings`, `GetCompanyWhiteLabelSettings` and `GetAdditionalWhiteLabelSettings` return the settings in `response` (`TenantWalletSettingsDto`, `TenantAuditSettingsDto`, `CompanyWhiteLabelSettingsDto`, `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettingsDto`) instead of a `settings` property; `SaveAuthKeys` takes `SaveAuthKeysRequestDto` and `GetAuthServices` returns `AuthServiceArrayWrapper`
- Renamed other models whose names did not say what they carry: `Status` → `ExternalShareStatus`, `Options` → `DocumentOptionsDto`, `STRINGArrayWrapper` → `StringArrayWrapper`, `EncryprtionStatus` → `EncryptionStatus`, `AceShortWrapper` → `AceShortDto`, `MentionWrapper` → `MentionDto`, `TimezonesRequestsDto` → `TimezoneDto`, `GroupMemberSecurityRequestDto` → `GroupMemberSecurityDto`, `SmtpOperationStatusRequestsDto` → `SmtpOperationStatusDto`, `KeyValuePairBooleanString` → `ItemKeyValuePairBooleanString`, `HistoryData` → `HistoryDataDto`, `HistoryAction` → `HistoryActionDto`, `Area` → `AccountSearchArea`, `Location` → `RequestLocation`, `TfaRequestsDtoType` → `TfaType`, and the backup request models after their operation (`BackupDto` → `StartBackupRequestDto`, `BackupRestoreDto` → `StartBackupRestoreRequestDto`, `BackupScheduleDto` → `CreateBackupScheduleRequestDto`, `Cron` → `BackupCronRequest`)
- Operations that returned an untyped `ObjectWrapper` or `ObjectArrayWrapper` now return a typed model: `StringWrapper` (`GetPortalPath`, `GetPortalHostname`, `GetGreetingSettings`, `GetThirdPartyCode`), `StringArrayWrapper` (`GetRoomTagsInfo`), `TokenDiagnosticsWrapper` (`GetClaims`), `AuditTrailProductArrayWrapper` (`GetAuditTrailMappers`), `AuditTrailTypesWrapper` (`GetAuditTrailTypes`), `EnabledModuleArrayWrapper` (`GetEnabledModules`), `SocketSettingsWrapper` (`GetSocketSettings`), `SsoSettingsConstantsWrapper` (`GetSsoSettingsV2Constants`), `AmazonS3RegionArrayWrapper` (`GetAmazonS3Regions`), `AccountEntryArrayWrapper` (`GetAccountsEntriesWith*Shared`)
- Other return types: `DeleteFileVersions` returns `FileOperationArrayWrapper`, `SearchUsersByQuery` returns `EmployeeFullArrayWrapper`, `ChangeDefaultAccessRights` returns `FileShareResponseArrayWrapper`, `UpdateCdnStorage` returns `StorageSettingsWrapper`, `GetAiPrices` returns `AiPricesWrapper`, `GetRestrictedAiModels` and `SetRestrictedAiModels` return `RestrictedAiModelsWrapper`; `DeleteGroup` and `DeleteRecent` return no body
- Renamed the AI operations after their tag, so the method names change: `CreateAgent` → `AiAgentsCreate`, `GetAgents` → `AiAgentsList`, `GetAgentInfo` → `AiAgentsGet`, `GetAgentsNewItems` → `AiAgentsNews`, `UpdateAgent` → `AiAgentsUpdate`, `DeleteAgent` → `AiAgentsDelete`, `UpdateAgentsQuota` → `AiAgentsUpdateQuota`, `ResetAgentsQuota` → `AiAgentsResetQuota`, `GetAiSettings` → `AiSettingsGet`, `GetAiUserSettings` → `AiSettingsGetUser`, `SetAiUserSettings` → `AiSettingsSetUser`, `GetVectorizationSettings` → `AiSettingsGetVectorization`, `SetVectorizationSettings` → `AiSettingsSetVectorization`, `StartTask` → `AiVectorizationStartTask`; in Files, `ChangeDownloadZipFromBody` → `ChangeDownloadZip`
- The AI agent operations take the agent `id` as a string and use their own `Ai`-prefixed models (`AiFolderWrapper`, `AiFolderContentWrapper`, `AiFileOperationWrapper`, `AiAgentsCreateRequest`, `AiAgentsUpdateRequest` and others) instead of the models of the Files API; `AiSettingsSetUser` and `AiSettingsSetVectorization` take the settings as a `map[string]*interface{}`
- The OAuth 2.0 client and scope operations call `/api/2.0/oauth2/clients` and `/api/2.0/oauth2/scopes` instead of `/api/2.0/clients` and `/api/2.0/scopes`; `GetClients` returns `PageableClientResponse`, `GetClientsInfo` returns `PageableClientInfoResponse` (renamed from `PageableResponseClientInfoResponse`), `GetScopes` returns `[]ScopeResponse` instead of one `ScopeResponse`, and `ChangeActivation`, `DeleteClient`, `DeleteTenantClients`, `DeleteUserClients`, `RevokeUserClient`, `UpdateClient` and `HandleOptions` return only the `*http.Response` instead of a `map[string]interface{}`; `NewCreateClientRequest` and `NewUpdateClientRequest` take every required field as an argument, and `UpdateClientRequest` takes `redirect_uris` and `scopes`
- `CheckMoveOrCopyBatchItems` and `CheckMoveOrCopyDestFolder` take the batch as separate parameters (`folderIds`, `fileIds`, `destFolderId`, `conflictResolveType`, `deleteAfter`, `content`, `toFillOut`, `returnSingleOperation`) instead of one `inDto` object, which is how the server reads them
- Parameter changes: the date filters of `GetFileHistory`, `GetFolderHistory`, `GetAuditEventsByFilter` and `GetLoginEventsByFilter` are `time.Time` instead of `ApiDateTime`; `serviceName` of `GetCustomerOperations` and of `CustomerOperationsReportRequestDto` is a list; `SearchArea` is a string enum sent by name (`"Active"`, `"Archive"`, ...) instead of a number, and its constants are upper-case (`SEARCHAREA_Active` → `SEARCHAREA_ACTIVE`, `SEARCHAREA_RecentByLinks` → `SEARCHAREA_RECENT_BY_LINKS`); `GetRoomGroups` takes `searchArea` instead of `id`; `EditorConfigurationDto.encryptionKeys` is a list of `EncryptionKeyDto`; `GetIsProductAdministrator` takes `ProductId(...)` and `UserId(...)` instead of `Productid(...)` and `Userid(...)`

### Removed

- Removed the superseded AI API services `AIChatAPIService`, `AIMCPAPIService`, `AIMessagesAPIService` and `AIProvidersAPIService` (`api-ai-chat.go`, `api-aimcp.go`, `api-ai-messages.go`, `api-ai-providers.go`) together with their models (`ChatDto`, `MessageDto`, `McpServerDto`, `AiProviderDto`, `ModelDto` and others); the web search settings moved from `GetWebSearchSettings`/`SetWebSearchSettings` to `AIWebSearchAPIService`
- Removed the request models `SetAiUserSettingsRequestDto` and `SetEmbeddingConfigRequestBody`, the `AiSettingsDto` properties that described the old AI chat (`webSearchEnabled`, `portalMcpServerId`, `modelAliases`, the `*ToolName` properties and others) and the model properties of `ChatSettingsDto` (`providerId`, `modelId`, `modelAlias`, `capabilities`, `multimodal`, `thinking`, `internal`)
- Removed `GetPrivacyFolder` and `IsAvailablePrivacyRoomSettings` (Files), `GetCustomerAiBalance` and `CreditAiBalance` (Payment)
- Removed the `subjectFilter` parameter of `GetRoomsFolder` and `AiAgentsList` with its `SubjectFilter` enum, the `MessageAction` values `MESSAGEACTION_PrivacyRoomEnable` and `MESSAGEACTION_PrivacyRoomDisable`, and the `public` property of the OAuth 2.0 client models
- Removed the server-side models that no operation uses any more: `DbTenant`, `DbTenantPartner`, `AuthData`, `OAuth20Token`, `UploadRequestDto`, `ContentDisposition`, `ContentType`, `NoContentResult`, `NoContentResultWrapper` and `StatusCodeResult`
- The third-party accounts returned by `GetThirdPartyAccounts` no longer have the `auth_data` property, and the devices returned by `DocRegisterPusnNotificationDevice` and `SubscribeDocumentsPushNotification` no longer have `tenant`; neither was ever filled in

### Fixed

- Fixed the usage sample not building: `samples/docspace-api-sdk-go-sample/go.mod` declared `go 1.22` while the SDK module requires `go >= 1.23.0`, so `go build` stopped with `requires go >= 1.23.0`; the sample now declares `go 1.23.0` and builds against the SDK checkout next to it

